1
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:28,490
At the end of a breath quietly fading away

2
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:34,880
Your name still spreads through me

3
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:38,380
Across these fingertips that couldn't hold you

4
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:41,760
The warmth that still remains

5
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:48,120
Still wakes me from my sleep…

6
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:51,500
Through fragments of memories passing by

7
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:55,450
I hear your voice trembling

8
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:58,930
As if waking from a dream…

9
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:04,660
I wander once again, searching for you…

10
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:07,890
At the end of a vanished dream

11
00:01:07,890 --> 00:01:11,760
If I call your name, will it reach you?

12
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,480
Even the faintest light

13
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:18,440
Is still so vivid to me

14
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:21,640
Even if I can never go back

15
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:25,490
I hold on to the you from back then

16
00:01:25,490 --> 00:01:28,920
Embracing this scattered heart…

17
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:37,080
I draw you once again.

18
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:43,940
In the heart of a street drowned in darkness

19
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:50,380
I keep walking, following only your shadow

20
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:53,790
Without leaving a single word behind

21
00:01:53,790 --> 00:01:57,220
My fallen night

22
00:01:57,220 --> 00:02:03,670
Still cries out for you…

23
00:02:03,670 --> 00:02:06,900
Within the gaps of frozen time

24
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:10,930
Only your touch is still alive

25
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:14,370
Unable to hold on…

26
00:02:14,370 --> 00:02:20,090
It binds me once again…

27
00:02:20,090 --> 00:02:23,260
At the end of a vanished dream

28
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:27,180
If I call your name, will it reach you?

29
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:28,880
Even the faintest light

30
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:33,860
Is still so vivid to me

31
00:02:33,860 --> 00:02:37,080
Even if I can never go back

32
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:40,920
I hold on to the you from back then

33
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:44,340
Embracing this scattered heart…

34
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:59,790
I draw you once again.

35
00:02:59,790 --> 00:03:03,200
The pieces of my heart that fell apart

36
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:06,640
Reconnect to you, one by one

37
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:09,660
Even if it's a broken dream…

38
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:14,970
I still can't forget you.

39
00:03:14,970 --> 00:03:18,300
At the end of a vanished dream

40
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:21,890
Even when I call your name, it won't reach you

41
00:03:21,890 --> 00:03:23,860
Only tearful memories

42
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:28,700
Smile at me as they gently sway

43
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:31,930
I know there's no way back

44
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:35,770
Still, I hold you close

45
00:03:35,770 --> 00:03:39,220
And cross this deepening night…

46
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:49,730
Once again, toward you.